          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Successive and filmed observations of fixed light phenomena in the sky: certain misidentifications with the following astronomical objects: Arcturus, Vega, Capella, Aldébaran, Sirius, Jupiter, and Regulus.",
